WEBVTT

00:02.260 --> 00:05.270
I apologize for my sudden discourtesy.

00:05.800 --> 00:07.520
I have something I wish to ask of you.

00:07.920 --> 00:08.840
Would you please...

00:10.890 --> 00:13.770
do me the honor of becoming my wife?

00:15.640 --> 00:17.360
What? Your wife?

00:17.360 --> 00:18.160
Yes.

00:18.480 --> 00:20.040
Me, become your wife?

00:20.040 --> 00:21.290
That's right.

00:27.790 --> 00:29.480
I respectfully decline.

00:34.190 --> 00:35.510
<i>Why?</i>

00:36.170 --> 00:38.990
<i>Why is he laughing like 
he's really enjoying this?</i>

02:11.510 --> 02:17.340
Th-The Crown Prince of Galkhein 
proposed marriage to Rishe?!

02:17.950 --> 02:20.990
<i>The man who killed me is proposing to me?</i>

02:21.200 --> 02:23.340
<i>It doesn't make sense. I don't 
understand what his aims are.</i>

02:31.750 --> 02:32.560
It's the king!

02:32.560 --> 02:33.530
Why is the king here?

02:33.530 --> 02:34.250
Your Majesty!

02:34.490 --> 02:35.500
Father!

02:35.500 --> 02:37.760
Why would you come all this way—

02:39.290 --> 02:40.100
Your Majesty?

02:39.290 --> 02:41.420
F-Father! The stones...

02:40.100 --> 02:43.430
Prince Arnold, my idiot son has 
shown you unthinkable rudeness!

02:41.420 --> 02:43.430
The stones are digging into my face!

02:43.430 --> 02:44.570
F-Father, I, um...

02:43.430 --> 02:47.180
Lady Rishe, I truly apologize for 
the matter of the broken engagement.

02:44.570 --> 02:47.180
M-My beautiful face is going 
to be full of stones...

02:47.180 --> 02:49.120
I offer you my heartfelt apologies.

02:49.120 --> 02:51.940
I believe you have heard 
Prince Arnold's intentions,

02:51.940 --> 02:53.910
but I ask it of you as well.

02:51.940 --> 02:53.910
They're going to leave scars.

02:59.060 --> 03:03.710
This trifling matter will cause no discord
 in the friendship between our nations.

03:04.820 --> 03:09.350
But if at all possible, I would ask
 for some time to speak with her.

03:10.020 --> 03:12.300
P-Please go with him, Lady Rishe.

03:11.350 --> 03:12.300
Ow!

03:13.680 --> 03:17.380
Should you refuse, I will simply 
proceed to the next tactic.

03:21.170 --> 03:23.640
What exactly are you plotting?

03:23.640 --> 03:25.040
Nothing.

03:25.040 --> 03:27.060
I've fallen completely in 
love with you, that's all.

03:27.060 --> 03:28.110
Fallen in...

03:28.980 --> 03:32.650
With your engagement broken, you no longer 
have anyone backing you, correct?

03:34.000 --> 03:38.820
<i>He's right. In my first life, I 
would have leaped at this chance.</i>

03:39.080 --> 03:44.880
<i>But as I am now... I know that 
life holds infinite opportunities.</i>

03:45.670 --> 03:46.460
<i>Still...</i>

03:46.870 --> 03:50.290
<i>The Savage Emperor. The Invader.</i>

03:50.850 --> 03:55.630
<i>In all of the lives I've lived, 
he's instigated a war.</i>

03:56.560 --> 03:58.280
<i>Why would he do such a thing?</i>

03:58.740 --> 04:00.890
<i>If I stay by his side, 
will I learn the reason?</i>

04:02.440 --> 04:05.500
You say that you've fallen in love with me.

04:05.500 --> 04:07.700
That's why I proposed marriage.

04:07.700 --> 04:11.130
Then will you agree to a few 
selfish requests of mine?

04:11.130 --> 04:15.650
If it lies within my power, I swear that 
I shall make your every wish come true.

04:15.650 --> 04:18.540
First, everything needed 
for the marriage ceremony

04:18.540 --> 04:21.530
will be procured through the 
trading company that I specify.

04:21.860 --> 04:23.280
As you like.

04:23.280 --> 04:27.280
After we are married, please provide a space 
where I may receive guests from other countries.

04:27.280 --> 04:30.410
As the wife of the crown prince, you would 
be asked to do such things in any case.

04:30.410 --> 04:33.160
I would prefer to live 
separately from the emperor.

04:33.380 --> 04:35.670
If it's for you, I would do anything.

04:36.610 --> 04:39.570
Lastly, I have one more very important point.

04:41.290 --> 04:44.800
I will absolutely laze around the castle!

04:45.060 --> 04:48.050
I will loaf about, idle my days 
away, and do no work at all!

04:51.310 --> 04:55.800
Oh. Additionally, I request that you 
lay not a single finger on me, please.

05:36.980 --> 05:38.850
What do you mean to do with that hand?

05:39.610 --> 05:44.150
You promised, didn't you? I asked you 
not to lay a single finger on me.

05:45.070 --> 05:47.030
Don't regard me with such contempt.

05:47.030 --> 05:50.290
I was simply trying to retrieve 
that which you took from me.

05:55.390 --> 05:58.420
I'm so terribly sorry!

05:59.630 --> 06:03.920
Slumped over with a sword for support... 
I'm amazed you could sleep like that.

06:05.100 --> 06:09.580
<i>To think that I used the sword that 
impaled me in place of a pillow...</i>

06:09.580 --> 06:12.680
It's incredible that you sensed 
me without my touching you.

06:12.960 --> 06:17.140
To reach such a level, you 
must have trained quite a lot.

06:17.140 --> 06:19.280
Y-Yes, I did.

06:24.510 --> 06:28.780
I've invited the trading company
 you selected for a meeting.

06:28.780 --> 06:30.720
Thank you.

06:30.720 --> 06:32.150
The Aria Trading Company.

06:33.180 --> 06:36.520
There's been talk of that company lately.

06:36.520 --> 06:38.440
Do you patronize them regularly?

06:38.440 --> 06:43.540
No. I've simply heard that 
they procure very fine goods.

06:43.540 --> 06:47.970
<i>I want to interact with them as 
soon as possible in this life, too.</i>

06:51.220 --> 06:53.740
<i>The devastating power of 
incredibly good looks...</i>

06:55.120 --> 06:55.970
What is it?

06:55.970 --> 06:57.820
Oh! It's nothi—

06:58.180 --> 06:59.190
Stop the horses!

06:59.190 --> 07:00.350
Enemy attack!

07:09.440 --> 07:10.890
Um, I—

07:10.890 --> 07:12.960
You stay here and behave.

07:15.450 --> 07:18.550
There are knights here. Why 
would he go to fight himself?

07:21.850 --> 07:24.860
<i>He told me to behave, but...</i>

07:42.590 --> 07:44.060
Finished already?

07:46.320 --> 07:50.400
And when I took the trouble 
to face you by myself, too.

07:50.800 --> 07:53.660
This didn't even serve to stave off boredom.

07:55.850 --> 07:57.580
Arrest the brigands.

07:57.580 --> 07:59.610
Those with nothing else 
to do, see to the wounded.

07:59.610 --> 08:00.540
Sir!

08:03.110 --> 08:04.540
<i>He hasn't killed them.</i>

08:05.760 --> 08:07.060
<i>Not a single one of them.</i>

08:08.520 --> 08:10.460
What's wrong, Kamil?

08:10.460 --> 08:11.550
Hurry!

08:13.760 --> 08:15.370
Are you all right? Hey!

08:15.370 --> 08:16.530
Is something wrong?

08:16.530 --> 08:19.500
My body... feels numb.

08:26.700 --> 08:27.900
Poison, is it?

08:27.900 --> 08:31.740
Tie off a spot between the wound and the heart immediately, then suck the poison out.

08:31.740 --> 08:32.730
Sir!

08:32.730 --> 08:35.590
<i>A scent like that of an overripe apple...</i>

08:35.590 --> 08:38.740
<i>This is an anesthetic made of shea 
grass and bluecap rock mushrooms.</i>

08:38.740 --> 08:41.680
It's likely something that 
hunters in this area use.

08:41.680 --> 08:45.840
While it won't be fatal, the effect 
will last for several days.

08:45.840 --> 08:48.250
It will take another two 
days to reach Galkhein.

08:48.250 --> 08:50.260
If we look after them as we travel, then...

08:51.130 --> 08:53.930
We passed a hunting settlement along the way.

08:53.930 --> 08:55.410
We'll return there and procure the antidote.

08:55.410 --> 08:56.270
Excuse me.

08:57.140 --> 08:59.890
I can make an antidote.

09:00.200 --> 09:00.990
What?

09:02.740 --> 09:05.890
It's lucky that I'm able to make 
this with the plants I have on hand.

09:05.890 --> 09:09.150
It's actually more effective if it's boiled,

09:09.360 --> 09:11.460
but as haste is needed here, let's use this.

09:20.540 --> 09:23.010
<i>Could it be that they're suspicious of me?</i>

09:29.470 --> 09:29.840
Hey!

09:31.840 --> 09:32.690
What are you doing?

09:32.690 --> 09:35.090
It's all right. Please don't worry.

09:35.090 --> 09:40.600
This antidote is made of liquori grass 
and luqua flowers with some carilya nuts.

09:40.980 --> 09:44.600
Please, make your decision. Will 
you use this medicine right now,

09:44.950 --> 09:47.920
or will you endure that numbness 
for the next few days?

09:47.920 --> 09:49.610
Right, Your Highness?

09:51.780 --> 09:54.110
I'm glad that nothing terrible happened.

09:54.510 --> 09:58.610
That aside, for what purpose do you 
suppose that you have guards with you?

09:58.910 --> 10:02.800
Rather than sustaining losses by having 
knights fight off the battlefield,

10:02.800 --> 10:05.900
stepping in myself better protects 
our national interests.

10:05.900 --> 10:07.580
And we did, in fact, sustain casualties.

10:07.580 --> 10:09.670
You say that with the benefit of hindsight.

10:09.670 --> 10:12.380
And the fact that you brought 
Lady Rishe out here with you...

10:12.380 --> 10:14.020
That was not my doing.

10:19.960 --> 10:23.350
So, the flowers weren't simply to 
look at, they were for practical use.

10:24.290 --> 10:26.860
How did you get out of the carriage?

10:26.860 --> 10:28.390
It's a secret.

10:31.060 --> 10:32.720
<i>In my life as a maid,</i>

10:32.720 --> 10:35.900
<i>my lady would often lock 
herself in her rooms,</i>

10:35.900 --> 10:38.220
<i>and every time, I'd have to unlock the doors.</i>

10:47.410 --> 10:50.410
<i>Is he a child staring at a line of ants?</i>

10:51.480 --> 10:53.450
Is there something on your mind?

10:53.450 --> 10:57.700
I have no hidden purpose. I was simply 
thinking that you are unfathomable.

10:58.920 --> 11:02.640
What means will you use 
to entertain me next?

11:02.640 --> 11:04.430
I'm beside myself with anticipation.

11:04.430 --> 11:07.930
<i>He speaks of me as though 
I'm some rare beast.</i>

11:08.280 --> 11:11.510
I'm not doing this for 
Your Highness' amusement.

11:11.510 --> 11:12.590
I know.

11:15.840 --> 11:19.740
One of the knights you pressured 
into your threat-like choice

11:20.060 --> 11:22.260
is someone who once lived in the slums.

11:23.010 --> 11:25.860
Galkhein extols itself as a meritocracy,

11:25.860 --> 11:29.000
but there are many who are unfairly 
judged due to their origins.

11:29.000 --> 11:31.690
Even so, he has never caved 
to outside pressures.

11:31.690 --> 11:33.430
He worked hard and became a knight.

11:34.100 --> 11:38.380
The knight with the worst case of numbness
 hasn't been assigned here for very long.

11:38.720 --> 11:42.110
He trained himself night and day 
for the sake of this mission.

11:43.200 --> 11:47.850
The older knight was trying to protect that 
newer knight and was injured alongside him.

11:47.850 --> 11:49.770
He's a man who excels 
at looking after others.

11:49.770 --> 11:53.100
You know quite a lot about the knights.

11:53.840 --> 11:56.010
Because I've chosen all 
of them as my retainers.

12:04.870 --> 12:07.760
I thank you for saving them.

12:12.240 --> 12:15.380
<i>I don't understand anything anymore.</i>

12:15.630 --> 12:17.890
<i>Is this a false face of his?</i>

12:17.890 --> 12:19.140
<i>Or is it...</i>

12:21.470 --> 12:24.630
I simply made use of 
knowledge I happen to have.

12:25.800 --> 12:30.390
A noble lady who happens to have knowledge 
of herbalism? There can't be many of those.

12:30.390 --> 12:35.150
Now that I think of it, why 
were the knights so wary of me?

12:35.150 --> 12:38.390
They heard that you are a lady 
whose engagement has been broken.

12:38.390 --> 12:41.240
They've likely wondered what 
sort of villainess I'm marrying

12:41.240 --> 12:42.670
and have all sorts of notions.

12:42.670 --> 12:43.830
I see.

12:44.940 --> 12:49.510
Then, what did you say when you told 
His Majesty the Emperor about me?

12:49.510 --> 12:52.160
"She's from a ducal house with 
connections to the royal family,"

12:52.160 --> 12:54.150
"and was fiancée to the crown prince."

12:54.150 --> 12:56.520
"She's taken my fancy, so I've stolen 
her." That's what I told him.

12:56.520 --> 12:57.790
Stolen?

12:58.270 --> 13:01.800
Because the empress must be from the 
royal family of another country.

13:02.750 --> 13:04.970
You mean... a hostage.

13:05.990 --> 13:10.700
In Galkhein, there may be those 
who behave rudely toward you.

13:11.170 --> 13:13.010
If the worst happens, I will—

13:13.010 --> 13:15.690
But that's splendid!

13:15.690 --> 13:16.850
What is?

13:16.850 --> 13:21.440
If I'm treated as a hostage, then I won't 
be brought out for official duties, will I?

13:21.440 --> 13:23.300
Well, I suppose not.

13:23.300 --> 13:26.200
Wonderful! That means I might 
actually be able to laze around!

13:26.470 --> 13:28.260
Thank you, Your Highness!

13:28.850 --> 13:29.680
It's nothing.

13:29.680 --> 13:34.550
Oh, and while I'm thinking of it, you were 
about to take my hand earlier, weren't you?

13:34.550 --> 13:36.020
That was unavoidable.

13:36.020 --> 13:38.060
A promise is a promise.

13:45.200 --> 13:48.320
<i>Possessing fertile land 
and abundant resources,</i>

13:48.320 --> 13:51.760
<i>Galkhein influences every 
nation in the world.</i>

13:52.420 --> 13:54.520
<i>In all of my previous lives,</i>

13:54.800 --> 13:56.870
<i>it is the only country I've never visited.</i>

13:59.380 --> 14:01.130
So this is the imperial capital!

14:39.500 --> 14:41.560
Is something the matter?

14:42.010 --> 14:44.500
Preparations of the imperial 
villa have been delayed.

14:44.500 --> 14:47.600
I'm sorry, but today you'll be 
staying in a room for noble guests.

14:47.600 --> 14:50.980
There's no need for such considerations. 
I will be quite happy in the villa.

14:50.980 --> 14:54.010
It hasn't been used in a long 
time. It's in a terrible state.

14:54.010 --> 14:55.200
I don't mind.

14:55.500 --> 14:57.150
Besides, I...

14:57.150 --> 14:58.710
am a hostage!

14:59.410 --> 15:01.180
Why do you seem proud of that?

15:03.700 --> 15:09.170
<i>This place certainly hasn't been used in 
quite some time. There's so much dust.</i>

15:12.920 --> 15:13.850
Now then...

15:14.620 --> 15:16.350
Shall we begin?

15:16.770 --> 15:19.150
<i>The maid in me 
finds this quite exciting!</i>

15:19.150 --> 15:20.940
Excuse me, Lady Rishe?

15:20.940 --> 15:24.010
Is there anything that we might help with?

15:24.010 --> 15:27.570
I couldn't possibly ask my guards to clean.

15:27.570 --> 15:30.320
Then, at least allow us 
to carry in the furniture.

15:30.620 --> 15:32.170
Thank you so much!

15:42.770 --> 15:47.640
<i>A few years from now, Arnold Hein 
will kill his father, the emperor.</i>

15:47.640 --> 15:49.780
<i>Then, the war will begin.</i>

15:50.410 --> 15:52.810
<i>There may not be much point to it,</i>

15:52.810 --> 15:55.270
<i>but I'd like to keep him 
away from his father.</i>

15:56.350 --> 15:59.100
<i>Why did he wage war against the world?</i>

16:00.340 --> 16:03.700
<i>In all of my lives, the cause of my death</i>

16:03.700 --> 16:07.650
<i>has always been connected to 
the war started by Arnold Hein.</i>

16:10.320 --> 16:12.050
I am firmly opposed to war!

16:12.050 --> 16:13.740
If only it weren't for that war!

16:13.740 --> 16:17.760
And here's to a long life spent lazing around comfortably and without care!

16:17.760 --> 16:19.080
Are you seeing this?

16:19.080 --> 16:21.000
The novice is working so hard.

16:21.000 --> 16:23.290
No matter how hard you try, it won't work!

16:24.750 --> 16:28.770
We'll be chosen to be Her Highness 
the Crown Princess' maids.

16:29.540 --> 16:30.810
Are you all right?

16:31.200 --> 16:31.870
Yes.

16:31.870 --> 16:32.920
I haven't seen you before.

16:32.920 --> 16:35.640
She must be new. Look at 
how pretty her hands are.

16:35.640 --> 16:39.400
Unfortunately for you, the only ones 
capable of serving the crown princess

16:39.400 --> 16:42.140
are us, with our three years of 
experience working in the palace.

16:42.140 --> 16:43.350
Can you stand?

16:43.350 --> 16:44.060
Hey!

16:44.060 --> 16:45.300
Listen when we're speaking to you.

16:45.300 --> 16:49.560
If you intend to work as a lady's maid, 
learn to respect those with more experience.

16:49.560 --> 16:53.380
Those curtains. It would be better 
not to start washing them now.

16:53.380 --> 16:54.070
What?

16:54.070 --> 16:56.820
The days are long in the spring. 
There's enough time for them to dry.

16:56.820 --> 16:59.580
There will be a little rain later.

16:59.580 --> 17:01.480
What makes you so certain?

17:01.480 --> 17:05.390
The type of clouds. The 
birds are flying low, too.

17:05.390 --> 17:08.840
If you wash large articles now, 
it might make more work later.

17:09.650 --> 17:13.150
Nothing a novice like you says 
could possibly be accurate.

17:13.150 --> 17:15.140
Enough of this. Let's go.

17:15.140 --> 17:17.720
This nice weather is definitely 
going to last all day.

17:18.480 --> 17:20.380
Are you hurt anywhere?

17:20.380 --> 17:21.140
No.

17:21.920 --> 17:24.250
Thank you... very much.

17:24.250 --> 17:27.390
My name is Elsie. Thank you for saving me.

17:31.260 --> 17:33.310
That's gotten dirty, hasn't it...

17:34.810 --> 17:37.740
And when they were kind enough 
to provide me with it, too.

17:37.740 --> 17:40.300
It will be all right if 
we wash it right away.

17:40.300 --> 17:41.140
What?

17:41.140 --> 17:44.870
I did say that it would rain, 
but that fabric dries quickly.

17:44.870 --> 17:47.250
Mud gets deep between the threads,

17:48.060 --> 17:50.630
so please try tapping at it 
with this brush to wash it.

17:51.530 --> 17:52.750
Who are you?

17:55.010 --> 17:58.230
Come! We have to hurry 
before it starts raining!

18:10.800 --> 18:13.900
<i>Traveling to see every 
country in the world...</i>

18:14.450 --> 18:17.200
<i>That was the dream I had 
when I was a merchant.</i>

18:17.900 --> 18:21.910
<i>In lifetime after lifetime, I 
tried to fulfill that dream,</i>

18:21.910 --> 18:23.280
<i>but it never came true.</i>

18:24.320 --> 18:28.140
<i>And now, the one country I 
was never able to visit...</i>

18:28.140 --> 18:30.200
<i>I've finally managed to make it here!</i>

18:43.430 --> 18:45.070
Should you really be doing this?

18:45.070 --> 18:47.100
Slipping away in the middle 
of your official duties?

18:47.800 --> 18:50.810
Truly, you surprise me every time we meet.

18:50.810 --> 18:53.190
I've suppressed my presence.

18:53.190 --> 18:55.820
To think that you could 
sense me at such a distance.

18:55.820 --> 18:57.720
That wasn't kind of you.

18:57.720 --> 19:02.570
I know you adjusted the strength of your
 presence, testing to see when I would notice.

19:04.860 --> 19:06.140
What were you looking at?

19:06.900 --> 19:07.940
The city.

19:08.710 --> 19:11.210
What's that large building over there?

19:11.480 --> 19:12.790
A library.

19:12.790 --> 19:15.520
Books gathered from every other country 
are held there for safekeeping.

19:15.520 --> 19:17.230
Every country?

19:17.730 --> 19:19.880
And that beautiful little tower over there?

19:19.880 --> 19:21.220
A church.

19:21.220 --> 19:23.410
It also serves as a clock tower.

19:23.410 --> 19:25.260
Its bells ring at appointed times.

19:25.260 --> 19:27.060
Oh, how lovely!

19:27.060 --> 19:29.970
And there's a large marketplace 
over there, isn't there?

19:29.970 --> 19:33.050
It's the largest shopping street 
in the imperial capital.

19:33.050 --> 19:35.940
The stalls there handle wares that 
they receive just that morning.

19:35.940 --> 19:37.740
How splendid!

19:37.740 --> 19:39.840
Then, Your Highness, what 
about that pretty—

19:41.690 --> 19:43.460
Wh-What is it?

19:43.460 --> 19:46.140
I was wondering what you 
find so entertaining.

19:46.650 --> 19:49.090
You were pressured into a marriage 
to one of this country's royals.

19:49.090 --> 19:51.210
Would it really inspire such curiosity?

19:52.930 --> 19:55.210
It's something I've longed for.

19:55.550 --> 19:56.540
Longed for?

19:57.590 --> 20:00.970
I've wanted to come to this 
country for a very long time.

20:01.340 --> 20:04.010
The final push that made 
me agree to the marriage

20:04.010 --> 20:06.970
might have been the admiration 
that I've felt for this country.

20:07.210 --> 20:11.040
This country doesn't possess anything 
worth your admiration or longing.

20:11.040 --> 20:12.970
That's not true.

20:12.970 --> 20:14.980
Even in the information you just gave me...

20:14.980 --> 20:17.190
There are so many fascinating places here!

20:17.190 --> 20:21.350
And the faces of people in town shine 
so brightly! And there's also—

20:22.750 --> 20:25.920
Have I said something strange?

20:25.920 --> 20:28.800
I've never seen a person like you before.

20:28.800 --> 20:32.250
The substance of your statements, your 
knowledge, your physical ability...

20:32.730 --> 20:35.250
A simple nobleman's daughter would 
have no need of such things.

20:37.520 --> 20:42.380
You've been born to a duke's family. 
Your personal feelings are unnecessary.

20:42.380 --> 20:43.300
But, Mother!

20:43.300 --> 20:47.390
Your happiness lies in marrying into 
the royal family and bearing an heir.

20:47.390 --> 20:49.140
There are things I wish to learn!

20:49.140 --> 20:53.140
If you have enough knowledge to maintain 
appearances in social situations, that is enough.

20:53.370 --> 20:55.850
Focus on the homemaking arts, 
not academic study.

20:58.830 --> 21:01.740
Even if others may deem 
such things unnecessary,

21:01.740 --> 21:04.030
I treasure every single one of them.

21:04.840 --> 21:08.070
They are riches which I will never lose,

21:08.070 --> 21:10.600
and each is a precious piece of my life.

21:14.080 --> 21:17.820
Whether something has 
value or not in my life...

21:17.820 --> 21:19.840
I will decide that for myself!

21:22.630 --> 21:23.690
I know.

21:32.720 --> 21:35.980
You should do whatever you 
wish, without constraints.

21:36.940 --> 21:40.870
I swear to support you in your wishes
 and continue to assist you.

21:42.320 --> 21:43.420
Why?

21:44.140 --> 21:45.380
I told you.

21:45.380 --> 21:47.450
I've fallen completely in love with you.

21:47.450 --> 21:49.480
<i>Lies, as usual.</i>

21:50.000 --> 21:53.700
And these immeasurable abilities of yours...

21:54.140 --> 21:57.210
I don't find them pointless. I find them 
delightful, from the bottom of my heart.

22:00.160 --> 22:03.490
I thought I'd conveyed 
that much to you at least.

22:08.880 --> 22:10.750
Think of something you want.

22:11.890 --> 22:14.790
My agreement not to lay a finger on you.

22:14.790 --> 22:16.990
This time, I truly did break it.

22:26.440 --> 22:28.450
<i>I can't read him at all!</i>

22:28.450 --> 22:29.850
<i>Arnold Hein...</i>

22:30.480 --> 22:32.880
<i>what are you plotting?</i>
